# Per-machine hardware config: serial numbers, tubing volumes and reagent port
# names are specific to one rig. gui.py loads ./config.yaml automatically when
# present, so a committed copy would silently override every other machine's
# setup. Shareable examples belong in software/sample_config/.
software/config.yaml
# Local test sequence, swept in by a directory-wide git add. Belongs to the
# temperature-controller work, not here; add it deliberately if it should ship.
software/sample_sequences/temperature-test.yaml

